      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Strumento da dare a un Pokémon.\nPolvere argentea e brillante che potenzia le mosse\ndi tipo Coleottero.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An item to be held by a Pokémon. It’s a shiny\nsilver powder that will boost the power of\nBug-type moves.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "銀色に　輝く　粉。\n持たせると　むしタイプの\n技の　威力が　あがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "散发着银色光辉的粉末。\n携带后，虫属性的\n招式威力就会提高。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Polvo de brillo argénteo que fortalece los ataques de\ntipo Bicho. Debe llevarlo un Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
